{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotdog Hustler</strong> is a gritty, retro-style food truck sim where you run a dodgy hotdog stand in the backstreets of a crime-ridden city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc5 <strong>Serve sketchy customers</strong> \u2013 Each customer has unique preferences and behavior. Some are aggressive, some hilarious, and some... deeply unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf56 <strong>Grill, stack, and sauce</strong> \u2013 Cook hotdogs to order, slap on condiments, and assemble meals fast before customers get angry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Manage your stand</strong> \u2013 Set prices, accept bribes, upsell extras, and avoid getting robbed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfc <strong>PS2-era aesthetic</strong> \u2013 Janky animations, lo-fi visuals, and a VHS-tinted interface capture a nostalgic early 2000s vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc3 <strong>Day-by-day survival</strong> \u2013 You\u2019ll unlock new ingredients, encounter strange events, and try to keep your stand afloat while chaos unfolds around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game focuses on <strong>reaction-based gameplay</strong>, <strong>light strategy</strong>, and <strong>weird customer interactions</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733400?t=1751186506","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733400/afc7d9470b7231018d416444212c7036bb905b12/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751186506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733400/acab0335d04d151eefc2b466aadf1d955c2029ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751186506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733400/acab0335d04d151eefc2b466aadf1d955c2029ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751186506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjus